      "status": "answered",
      "body": "To complete the Python Programming course, submit all four graded labs, achieve at least 70% overall, and earn a Pass on the capstone project. The overall mark and capstone Pass are evaluated separately. A capstone resubmission is available once after written feedback. Completion appears in the LMS Results area after verification by the course coordinator.",
